<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Stinking Cloud</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Necromancer (guild level 30)
Mana: 28
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast stinking cloud &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast stinking cloud</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster holds a clawed hand before their face and mouths 'Cumus 
muerti', and the air around the target turns fetid and poisonous. The 
better your divine power and your poison sphere, the more it hurts. Like 
all the poison clouds, it does best against clothes and leather and much 
less against chain and plate, and a shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
